    +unit_id
    +approved_by
    +approved_at
    +results_hash
  }
  class ReleaseDecision {
    +id
    +unit_id
    +ReleaseDecisionKind decision
    +decided_by
    +reason_code
    +policy_version_id
  }
  class StorageTemperatureLog {
    +id
    +center_id
    +device_label
    +recorded_at
    +value_c
    +recorded_by
    +deviation
    +action_taken
  }
  BloodUnit "1" *-- "0..*" LabTestOrder : requires
  BloodUnit "1" *-- "0..*" LabSample : has
  LabTestOrder "1" *-- "0..*" LabResult : resolved by
  LabResult "1" *-- "0..*" LabResultReview : reviewed in
  LabResult "0..*" --> "0..1" LabResult : supersedes
  BloodUnit "1" --> "0..*" ResultApproval : approved by
  BloodUnit "1" --> "0..*" ReleaseDecision : decided in
  BloodCenter "1" --> "0..*" StorageTemperatureLog : logs
```

| Enumeration | Values |
|---|---|
| `ResultStatus` | `negative`, `reactive`, `invalid`, `inconclusive`, `determined` (ABO/Rh typing only) |
| `ReleaseDecisionKind` | `release`, `block`, `discard`, `retest_authorized` |

Constraints the diagram cannot show: a reviewer is never the performer, the physician who approves entered no result for the unit, and a unit is released only through `transition_unit` after the release gate G1 to G9 (SAD 7.2).

