```

| Enumeration | Values |
|---|---|
| `RequestStatus` | `Open`, `Covered`, `InFulfilment`, `Completed`, `PartiallyCompleted`, `Unfulfilled`, `CancelRequested`, `Cancelled` |
| `OfferStatus` | `offered`, `approved`, `expired`, `declined`, `released`, `sample_accepted`, `failed`, `matched`, `issued`, `dispatched`, `received`, `returned` |
| `PaperAuthorization` | `pending`, `verified` |
| `ReceiverType` | `courier`, `relative`, `hospital_staff` |

Constraints the diagram cannot show: a unit has at most one active reservation (a partial unique index on `reservation_item`), request status is derived from its offers, and `parent_request_id` is set only when a request asks for the missing quantity of an earlier request of the same institution.
